course: dictionary
lesson: 8214
title: Return: one word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word return can mean different things, so the words around it show you which meaning is right. To return is to come back or go back to a place: «the days pass, and never return» means time does not go back to where it was.
explain: To return something means to give it back or bring it back. «If a library book is damaged, you tell the librarian when you return it» means you bring the book back to the library. Here it is about giving back, not coming back to a place.
explain: Return can also be a noun, a thing or an event. «On her return» means on the day she came back. A return ticket is a ticket for there and back. Try swapping in «come back» or «give back» and see which one makes sense in the sentence.
fact: Return means to come back or go back to a place.
fact: To return something means to give it back or bring it back.
fact: A return can mean the going back or the coming back, as in «on her return».
fact: A return ticket or return trip is there and back.
fact: On a keyboard, the return key starts a new line.
exercise: In «If a library book is damaged, you tell the librarian when you return it», what does return mean? | To grow again | To write it down | To go to sleep | *To give it back
exercise: In «the walls shout it back: that returning sound is an echo», what does returning mean? | *Coming back as a sound | Buying something new | Going to sleep | Written in pencil
exercise: Mum says «on her return» means the day she came back. What is a return ticket? | A ticket to the moon | *A ticket for there and back | A ticket that costs nothing | A ticket for a boat only
test: In a story, «the hero's return» means | *The hero coming back | The hero's favourite meal | The hero's shoes | The hero's new sword
test: Tom must return the football to Sam, who lent it to him. What does return mean here? | To buy a new one | To hide in the garden | *To give back | To grow taller
exam: Read: «Telling someone your route and return time means help can start looking for you quickly.» What does return time mean? | The time it rains | The time you eat lunch | The time you go to school | *The time you come back
